{
  "version": "0.9.14",
  "notes": "<!-- dsh-notes:zh -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.14\n\n## 新增\n\n- 应用现在随包内置 OpenAI Sans Regular、Medium 和 Semibold，桌面界面可稳定呈现原设计使用的 400、510 与 590 字重。\n\n## 变更与安全\n\n- 顶部栏调整为 36px；默认按钮采用 20px 高度、12px 文字和 6px 圆角；输入框与选择器按场景统一为 22px、24px 和 28px。\n- 确认对话框采用 450px 最大宽度与 12px 圆角，命令面板采用 520px 最大宽度与 16px 圆角；工具提示改为 14px 深色浮层。\n- 预设选项采用中性卡片、16px 外圆和 6px 反色中心，选中标记不再改变行高；方向键、Home 和 End 可循环移动选择与焦点。\n\n## 修复与打磨\n\n- 设置页遇到异常的工作树接口返回值时会按空列表降级，不再因不可迭代数据而崩溃。\n- 浏览器模拟后端补齐启动设置、工作树与预设命令，可完整检查设置页和预设交互。\n\n## 安装\n\n- 可覆盖安装或使用应用内更新。Lite 首次运行需下载依赖；Full 附带离线运行时。\n- 三档 OpenAI Sans 字体均包含在 Lite 与 Full 的界面资源中，无需系统另行安装。\n\n## 验证\n\n- 本地生产构建、lint、277 项前端测试（语句覆盖率 95.1%）、59 项打包测试、408 项 Rust 测试、无障碍、公开契约与双语文档检查全部通过。\n- 浏览器在深浅主题下验证了输入框、展开选择器、单选项点击和键盘移动、命令面板、工具提示与字体加载；整页重载后错误日志为 0。\n- 发布流水线将在 Linux、Windows 与 macOS 上验证 Lite 和 Full 安装包，并执行 Windows 原位升级与完整卸载，通过后发布校验和及签名更新清单。\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:en -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.14\n\n## Fixes and polish\n\n- Bundle OpenAI Sans Regular, Medium, and Semibold so the interface consistently renders its intended 400, 510, and 590 weights without requiring a system-installed font.\n- Match the updated desktop reference with a 36 px title bar, 20 px default buttons, 22–28 px fields and selectors, a 450 px confirmation dialog, a 520 px command palette, and the corresponding 6–16 px corner radii.\n- Use compact 12 px controls and 14 px dark tooltips with restrained neutral fills and focused blue edges.\n- Render preset choices as neutral 16 px radios with a 6 px inverse center and stable selected-row geometry. Arrow, Home, and End keys now move selection and roving focus.\n- Degrade malformed worktree replies to an empty collection instead of crashing Settings, and complete the browser fixture for startup, worktree, and preset inspection.\n\n## Installation and limitations\n\n- Upgrade in place or use the in-app updater. Full includes offline dependencies; Lite downloads them when needed.\n- All three OpenAI Sans faces are included in both Lite and Full interface assets; no separate system installation is required.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Local production build, lint, 277 frontend tests at 95.1% statement coverage, 59 packaging tests, 408 Rust tests, accessibility checks, public-contract checks, and bilingual documentation checks passed.\n- Browser checks covered dark and light themes, fields, the open selector, pointer and keyboard radio selection, command-palette and tooltip geometry, loaded font faces, and a clean console after a full reload.\n- The release pipeline validates Lite and Full packages on Linux, Windows, and macOS, including an in-place Windows upgrade and clean uninstall, before publishing checksums and the signed updater manifest.\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:end -->",
